  "summary": "Arches on the footbar, heels together or feet wide: the tail curls a little off the carriage and stays there while the legs press the carriage out and in.",
  "steps": [
    "Lie on the back, arches on the footbar, headrest down.",
    "Curl the tail under to lift the pelvis a few centimetres.",
    "Keeping that height, press the carriage out until the legs are almost straight.",
    "Draw the carriage home without dropping the hips."
  ],
